      "text": "Tomorrow at 10am PT I'm hosting a live walkthrough of how we progressed from single-player Claude Code to multi-player Claude Tag. Then, we're going deep on how Claude Tag actually works.\n\nAI used to finish your sentence. Then, it wrote entire features. Now, Claude Tag can monitor your channels, do proactive work for you, the whole team can steer it, and it remembers what you told it last week.\n\nRegister: https://t.co/D8Lz61BXn4",
