    {
      "id": "2069474688619958517",
      "text": "I also have Claude monitoring Slack channels to proactively respond to people to answer their questions and draft PRs, and to react with specific emojis like ✅❌ when a thread is resolved.\n\nTo set it up, just add @.Claude to a channel and ask it to do this^, in natural language.",
      "author": {
        "id": "159337660",
        "name": "Boris Cherny",
        "screenName": "bcherny",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902044548936953856/J2jeik0t_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 155,
        "retweets": 3,
        "replies": 17,
        "quotes": 0,
        "views": 52729,
        "bookmarks": 37
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 23 17:36:29 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-23 13:36",
