      "id": "2069474687323893796",
      "text": "I tag Claude many times a day to write PRs, address user feedback, investigate incidents, do data analyses, summarize information, etc.\n\nUse it as your company's search engine. \"What's the status on X?\" \"Who owns this service?\" It answers your questions instead of just returning links. It’s been a huge unlock for onboarding new teammates.",
