    {
      "id": "2069474685948186797",
      "text": "We’ve worked hard to make it secure at every level. 1/ At the model training stage, 2/ the classifiers on top of our models and things like auto mode, 3/ we protect what Claude has access to (websites it can access and it can’t see the credential secrets it uses), and 4/ respecting channel/workspace boundaries",
      "author": {
        "id": "159337660",
        "name": "Boris Cherny",
